# One socket of the 7x7 board, drawn at 2x to fill a 64px cell.
#
# A recessed well rather than a raised tile: the gem sits *in* it, which is
# what makes an empty cell during a cascade read as a hole rather than as a
# missing sprite. Bright rim on top, dark floor — lit from above like
# everything else.
name puzzle-cell
size 32 32
key o outline
key L deep-3-tile
key m deep-2
key d deep-1
pixels
oooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo
oLLLLLLLLLLLLLLLLLLLLLLLLLLLLLLo
*2 oLmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmLo
*24 oLmddddddddddddddddddddddddddmLo
*2 oLmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmLo
ommmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmo
oooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo
